OL,3,GNEWSAClarkson's choir 'so excited' for
OL,4,ARoyal Variety show
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of Jeremy Clarkson's Hawkstone
OL,7,FFarmers' Choir has told the BBC he is
OL,8,F"very excited" to sing at the Royal
OL,9,FVariety Performance on Friday night.
OL,11,FThe ensemble, which won Britain's Got
OL,12,FTalent earlier this year, will sing in
OL,13,Ffront of the King and Queen as part of
OL,14,Fthe annual show - taking place this
OL,15,Fyear at the Royal Albert Hall.
OL,17,FThey are joined on the bill by Italian
OL,18,Fopera sensation Andrea Bocelli,
OL,19,Fsinger-songwriter turned Celebrity
OL,20,FTraitors sleuth James Blunt and the
OL,21,FWest End cast of Wicked.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
